{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "根据该论文，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，来自 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "FEVER 的 claim 依据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章构成的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "FEVER 的 claim 依据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "cloze_conversion", "text": "论文将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task，做法是掩蔽 claim 中出现的命名实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "label_subset", "text": "该分类器目前只能将 claim 分类为“SUPPORTS”和“MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "not_all_labels", "text": "作者说明其无监督模型并不支持所有标签，仅针对“SUPPORTS”标签报告标签准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "qg_accuracy", "text": "问题生成任务在将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task 时达到约 90% 的准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "label_accuracy", "text": "该方法在转换后数据集的开发集上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率，在测试集上达到 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "per_claim_questions", "text": "平均每条 claim 生成 3 个问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "thresholds", "text": "在 φ = 0.76 时，4 个问题中至少 3 个需回答正确；在 φ = 0.67 时，3 个问题中至少 2 个需回答正确，claim 才会被分类为“SUPPORTS”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t3", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking 报告 FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claims，来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章的语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "uqafc_accuracy", "text": "该模型的分类器在变换后数据集的 development set 上达到 80.2% 的 label accuracy，在 test set 上达到 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "uqafc_label_scope", "text": "该分类器目前只能将 claims 分为 \"SUPPORTS\" 和 \"MANUAL_REVIEW\"，其 80.2% 的 label accuracy 是针对 \"SUPPORTS\" 标签报告的。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "clinical_no_fever", "text": "Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network 未讨论 FEVER 数据集；它聚焦于使用 Mayo Clinic 的临床笔记和病理报告进行临床信息抽取。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "clinical_no_baseline_gain", "text": "所提供证据未报告该临床信息抽取模型相对于基线的任何定量提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-191faab23657f930ee0bcb86"}]}, {"key": "not_comparable", "text": "两篇论文处理不同任务（对维基百科 claims 进行事实核查 vs. 从临床文本中进行信息抽取）并使用不同数据集，因此它们的规模和性能数字不能直接比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
